5-02-14","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20250214901131"},{"id":"D20","kind":"DART 공시","title":"유상증자결정(종속회사의주요경영사항)","date":"2024-11-29","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20241129900669"},{"id":"D21","kind":"DART 공시","title":"타법인주식및출자증권취득결정","date":"2024-11-29","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20241129900631"},{"id":"D22","kind":"DART 공시","title":"최대주주변경","date":"2024-07-08","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20240708900354"},{"id":"D23","kind":"DART 공시","title":"매출액또는손익구조30%(대규모법인은15%)이상변동","date":"2024-02-15","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20240215900756"},{"id":"D24","kind":"DART 공시","title":"매출액또는손익구조30%(대규모법인은15%)이상변동","date":"2023-02-14","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230214900712"},{"id":"D25","kind":"DART 공시","title":"자기주식처분결과보고서","date":"2023-01-12","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230112000325"},{"id":"D26","kind":"DART 공시","title":"주요사항보고서(자기주식처분결정)","date":"2023-01-12","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230112000207"},{"id":"R","kind":"DART 사업보고서","title":"[기재정정]사업보고서 (2024.12) 'II. 사업의 내용'","date":"2025-03-31","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20250331002173"}]}